---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<Layout metadata={{ title: 'About' }}
  ><div class="design-content">
    <section
  class="page-intro page-hero about-page-hero"
  style="--page-art:url(/redesign/about-hero.png)"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="editorial-kicker">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>We Are<br />PYROS AI Creative.</h1>
    <p>
      PYROS AI Creative is an educational platform for creators who want
      to learn AI filmmaking and use artificial intelligence to tell
      better stories. We teach cinematic workflows, AI storytelling
      and practical production techniques—helping creators turn ideas
      into characters, worlds, scenes and complete stories.
    </p>
  </div>
</section><section class="editorial-section">
      <div class="wrap editorial-row">
        <div class="editorial-number">01</div><div class="editorial-copy">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Make Cinematic Storytelling<br />More Accessible.</h2><p>
            Filmmaking has traditionally required large teams, expensive equipment, locations and production budgets
            that put ambitious ideas beyond the reach of many creators.
          </p><p>AI is changing that.</p><p>
            Our mission is to give creators the knowledge, workflows and practical resources they need to transform
            ideas into cinematic productions.
          </p><p>
            We believe the future of filmmaking will not belong only to large studios. It will also belong to creators
            who know how to combine technology, visual storytelling and creative direction.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><section class="editorial-section">
      <div class="wrap editorial-row">
        <div class="editorial-number">02</div><div class="editorial-copy">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>
            Technology Is the Tool.<br />Storytelling Is the Craft.
          </h2><p>AI can generate an image, create a character, build a location or produce an entire scene.</p><p>
            But technology alone does not create a great story.
          </p><p>
            At PYROS AI Creative, we believe the creator remains at the center of the process. AI should expand creative
            possibilities, accelerate production and remove unnecessary barriers—not replace imagination, taste or
            storytelling.
          </p><p>The tools will change.<br />The models will evolve.<br />The craft remains.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><section class="editorial-section">
      <div class="wrap editorial-row">
        <div class="editorial-number">03</div><div class="editorial-copy">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">WHAT WE DO</p><h2>Learn. Create. Tell Stories.</h2><p>
            PYROS AI Creative focuses on the practical craft of AI filmmaking.
          </p><p>
            We create tutorials, AI Guides, workflows and production resources designed to help creators build real
            projects—not simply experiment with AI tools.
          </p><p>
            From character consistency and visual development to cinematic generation, scene creation and storytelling
            workflows, everything we create is built around one goal:
          </p><p>Turn ideas into finished stories.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><section class="editorial-section">
      <div class="wrap editorial-row">
        <div class="editorial-number">04</div><div class="editorial-copy">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">OUR VISION</p><h2>A New Generation<br />of Filmmakers.</h2><p>
            We are building toward a future where filmmaking is no longer defined by the size of a production team or
            the size of a budget.
          </p><p>
            A future where a creator can develop an idea, build an entire visual world and produce a cinematic story
            with the help of AI.
          </p><p>
            PYROS AI Creative aims to become a leading educational platform for this new generation of
            filmmakers—helping creators develop the creative and technical skills needed to shape the future of
            storytelling.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><section class="editorial-end">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="editorial-end-inner">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">CREATE CINEMATIC STORIES</p><h2>Your Story Starts Here.</h2><p>
            Every production begins with an idea.
          </p><p>PYROS AI Creative exists to help you take that idea further.</p><p>
            Learn the workflows. Develop your creative skills. Build your stories.
          </p><div class="actions">
            <a data-astro-reload class="btn" href="/tutorials">Explore Tutorials →</a><a
              data-astro-reload
              class="btn secondary"
              href="/ai-guides">Browse AI Guides →</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><div class="wrap related-about">
      <span class="eyebrow">Explore the possibilities</span><a data-astro-reload href="/why-ai-filmmaking"
        >Why AI Filmmaking <span>↗</span></a
      >
    </div>
  </div></Layout
